Core finding: doctor commands have zero advisor presence today (no graph nodes, no bridges); the fix is a `_routes.yaml`→`derive-command-bridges.cjs` harvester producing `kind:'command'` bridges — a data-source change, not scorer logic — plus a generic setup/health doctor target for the onboarding gap.

